        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Puzzle Bomber</strong> is a vibrant reimagining of classic arcade-style puzzle action, blending fast-paced strategy with explosive fun. Roll and drop colorful bombs onto the playfield, carefully stacking and positioning them to set up chain reactions, then detonate them once your meter is full to trigger massive combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the timing and placement of your bombs to chase new high scores and experiment with different setups, or jump into local multiplayer with up to four players to see who can outlast the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With easy-to-learn mechanics, dynamic gameplay depth, and nostalgic arcade flair, <strong>Super Puzzle Bomber</strong> delivers an energetic mix of strategy, precision, and explosive satisfaction.</p>",
